title: The Coalition Council
subtitle: Every unresolved bargain has found its way into the same room.
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: poland_government_card
view-if: left_in_government = 1 and government_has_confidence = 1 and caretaker_government = 0 and ministries_finalized = 1 and ministry_count >= 1 and month_actions < max_month_actions and poland_coalition_council_timer <= 0 and government_coalition_dissent >= 6
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; poland_coalition_council_timer = 4
card-image: img/poland/cards/government-affairs.webp

= The Coalition Council

KO has a veto list, PSL has several red lines and Poland 2050 has circulated a
diagram. Lewica's ministers have deadlines of their own. The council can
concentrate on shared delivery, exchange priorities or let the public see
where agreement ends.

- @delivery_cell
- @exchange_deadlines
- @publish_minutes

@delivery_cell
title: Staff a joint delivery cell
subtitle: Cost: 1 resource. Move disputes from leaders' offices into accountable work.
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: A joint delivery team requires one resource.
on-arrival: resources -= 1; government_coalition_dissent -= 6; ko_coalition_dissent -= 2; psl_coalition_dissent -= 2; p2050_coalition_dissent -= 2; government_delivery += 3; public_trust += 1; news_headline = "The coalition creates a joint delivery cell with published deadlines"

Officials receive named decisions, deadlines and escalation rules. The council
does not become friendlier, but it loses the ability to rediscover the same
disagreement every fortnight.

- #poland_card_finish


@exchange_deadlines
title: Exchange one Left deadline for one coalition concession
subtitle: Reduce cabinet tension by narrowing the immediate programme.
on-arrival: government_coalition_dissent -= 5; ko_relation += 2; psl_relation += 2; p2050_relation += 2; progressive_credibility -= 2; progressives_dissent += 4; government_delivery += 1; news_headline = "Coalition leaders trade deadlines and recover a working calendar"

One reform moves back and one material commitment moves forward. Ministers
leave with a calendar they can pass; activists leave with another reason to
ask whether governability always sends them the invoice.

- #poland_card_finish


@publish_minutes
title: Publish the disagreements and keep negotiating
subtitle: No resource or budget cost. Transparency is not harmony, but it is a floor.
on-arrival: public_trust += 3; constitutional_restraint += 2; party_unity += 1; government_coalition_dissent -= 1; ko_coalition_dissent += 1; psl_coalition_dissent += 1; p2050_coalition_dissent += 1; news_headline = "The coalition publishes its unresolved disputes instead of staging unanimity"

The minutes distinguish blocked policy from unfinished administration and
name which partner objects. The atmosphere worsens for an afternoon and the
public record improves for longer.

- #poland_card_finish
